; XAUUSD_Loma_TrendPullback v1.35 on BTCUSD - trailing result M10 + Step trailing, setup 1 of 3: sell, session AllDay server time, trend filter H4 EMA 50, target 3R. DO NOT LOAD ON GOLD.
; Trailing: every 0.5R of profit lifts the stop by 0.5R, one step behind (breakeven at +0.5R). Needs EA v1.35 or later (TrailMode 4, TrailParam 0).
; Picked on Jan 2025 - May 15 2026 only (score 1.32): 167 trades, PF 1.70.
; UNSEEN May 16 - Nov 13 2026: this setup 75 trades, PF 1.88, net +18.5R; the 3 setups of this combination together 161 trades, PF 1.36 (stressed 1.26).
; EARLIER DATA, before the calibration period: 2024: this setup 122 trades, PF 0.99; 2023: this setup 111 trades, PF 0.92. The combination together: 2024 PF 1.12 (310 trades); 2023 PF 0.79 (291 trades). The 2026 result did NOT hold on earlier data: UNPROVEN, demo and Strategy Tester only.
; Data: Binance BTCUSDT M1 in broker server time, assumed spread 10 USD. Points are 0.01 USD: 2000 points = 20 USD.
; Times are BROKER SERVER TIME (New York + 7 h: GMT+2 in the US winter, GMT+3 in the US summer).
; UseNewsFilter was not in the backtest.
